OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fpersisting at first through the
OL,7,Fevening before isolated showers become
OL,8,Fconfined to the northwest. Cloud
OL,9,Fbreaking up, leaving clear spells for
OL,10,Fmany. Winds also die down into the
OL,11,Fearly hours. Feeling cool overnight
OL,12,Ffor many.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FAny showers in the
OL,15,Fnorthwest will clear through the
OL,16,Fmorning, leaving a mostly dry and
OL,17,Fbright day with sunny spells. Light
OL,18,Fwinds making it feel slightly warmer
OL,19,Fthan Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
