OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FStaying changeable through the week,
OL,7,Fas another band of rain moves eastward
OL,8,Flater Thursday, before drier and
OL,9,Fbrighter weather returns on Friday.
OL,10,FWith unsettled conditions once again
OL,11,FSaturday afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
